{
  "about": "Booharu's hand-edit record, booharu.auto, as a block may hold it. In cases, whether its marker of a translation typed by hand reads: booharu-core's attrs.rs tests hold Auto::of to these answers and tests/booharu/typed-by-hand.test.ts holds the interface's typedByHand to the same ones, so a record the desktop can't read, which it takes for none, marker and all, never reads as typed by hand in the interface. In stricter, forms booharu-core reads the marker from and Booharu never writes, which the interface reads as none, so it may miss a marker but never reads one the desktop doesn't.",
